00:08:56,699 --> 00:09:02,099
And then once it's rewritten, now we have
basically this pod to pod communication.

117
00:09:02,099 --> 00:09:07,051
So now it can go through that CNI zero,
it can go through that VXLAN tunnel,

118
00:09:07,051 --> 00:09:11,074
whatever is needed to get it
to the particular destination.

119
00:09:11,074 --> 00:09:16,904
And so this case,
it'll be able to make its way there.

120
00:09:16,904 --> 00:09:20,414
All right,
now let's look at pod to external.

121
00:09:20,414 --> 00:09:24,969
So this is the case
